From: saikatnjm <saikatnjm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:01:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add full Bangla (bn) version with EN/BN toggle

- i18n foundation: locale context, typed EN/BN UI dictionary, (en) route
  group (English URLs unchanged), /bn layout with Bangla chrome and lang=bn
- /bn routes: home, calculators index, calculator pages (page registry),
  categories, about, privacy, terms - all static
- Bangla SEO: summaryBn/seoBn/faqsBn for all 10 calculators, hreflang
  alternates (en-BD/bn-BD/x-default), localized OG and JSON-LD, bilingual
  sitemap
- All 10 calculator widgets fully localized (labels, errors, results,
  share text) via per-widget strings + useLocale; logic unchanged
- Bangla content pages and FAQs for all 10 calculators
- Bangla-capable format helpers (dates, weekdays, counts), bilingual
  validation messages, localized search index, header language toggle
